Subject: [PATCH 81/81] linux-pro1x: IMX582 1984x1488 mode, the whole array 4x4
 binned

From kabouik's Guix port (fxtec-pro1x-guix 4403a06, device/kernel/patches/pro1x-imx582-4x3.patch), applied unchanged.
---
 drivers/media/i2c/imx582.c | 130 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 130 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/imx582.c b/drivers/media/i2c/imx582.c
index 0dfe7acbd..99732be4b 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/imx582.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/imx582.c
@@ -1023,6 +1023,126 @@ static const struct cci_reg_sequence imx582_mode_1920x1080_regs[] = {
 	{ CCI_REG8(0x4035), 0xf0 },
 };
 
+/*
+ * 1984x1488, 4x4 binned, the whole array: the 1080p mode with every row
+ * read (Y 0-5999), 1488 of the 1500 binned rows kept (digital crop, 6 off
+ * the top) and a frame of 1570 lines (67 fps).  A fast 4:3 viewfinder that
+ * shows all of a 4000x3000 photo.
+ */
